<!--
    Every word the app says, in the language it was written in. A
    translation is the same file under `values-<language>/`, with the
    same names and the same format arguments; `StringsTest` is what
    checks that, and ANDROID.md says how to add one.

    Not here, on purpose: the changelog (CHANGELOG.md, shipped as an
    asset and shown in About as it was written), the model directory
    names the download lines quote, and the engine's own error
    messages, which are what a report needs to say rather than what a
    reader needs to read.
-->
